---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Coyote & Quill — Advisory · Strategy · Build"
  description="Coyote & Quill helps leaders answer the question every AI vendor skips — do you even need AI? — then builds what's worth building. Observe. Assess. Advise."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-layout">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="hero-eyebrow">
          <span class="label">Est. 2026</span>
        </div>
        <h1>Precision strategy<br />for <em>consequential</em> problems.</h1>
        <p class="hero-tagline">
          Coyote &amp; Quill helps leaders answer the question every AI vendor skips — <em>do you even need this?</em> — then builds what's worth building. With the discipline of a combat advisor and the craft of a practitioner.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-motto" aria-label="Firm motto">
          <span>Observe</span>
          <div class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <span>Assess</span>
          <div class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <span>Advise</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="/services" class="btn btn-primary">View Services</a>
          <a href="/about" class="btn btn-outline">About the Firm</a>
        </div>
      </div>
        <div class="hero-seal" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="/assets/logo/cq-seal-02.svg" alt="" width="400" height="400" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <p class="label">What We Do</p>
        <h2>Three questions every leader is asking.<br />We answer all three.</h2>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <p>We don't sell subscriptions or generic frameworks. We take on a small number of engagements and go deep. Every engagement produces something the client keeps using after we leave.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-number">01</p>
          <p class="card-question">"Do I even need AI — and where do I start?"</p>
          <h3>AI Implementation Strategy</h3>
          <p>We answer honestly — sometimes the answer is no — then build what's worth building.</p>
          <a href="/services#implementation">Learn more →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-number">02</p>
          <p class="card-question">"How do I build something real — fast, without hiring developers?"</p>
          <h3>Vibe Coding Engagement</h3>
          <p>Five days to a deployed tool your team built — and the doctrine to build the next one without us.</p>
          <a href="/services#vibe-coding">Learn more →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-number">03</p>
          <p class="card-question">"I need a tool built to last — and it has to survive compliance."</p>
          <h3>Custom App Development</h3>
          <p>The tool that makes the strategy permanent. Built to survive production and the auditor.</p>
          <a href="/services#app-dev">Learn more →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div>
          <p class="label">Why Coyote &amp; Quill</p>
          <h2>The credentials are not borrowed.</h2>
          <div class="divider"></div>
          <p>Retired United States Marine Corps AH-1W Cobra pilot. TTECG Coyote. Combat advisor to Mongolian, Georgian, and Iraqi Security Forces. AI adoption practitioner building and deploying systems at a healthcare startup — across product, operations, compliance, and customer success simultaneously.</p>
          <p>Here's why that matters to you. A combat advisor drops into an unfamiliar culture and organization, reads it accurately, and helps its people build a capability they keep long after he's gone. Coyote &amp; Quill does the same with AI: work across your culture and your organization, strip out the noise, and deliver a solution you carry into your future — not a dependency on a consultant.</p>
          <a href="/about" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-top: 8px;">Full Background →</a>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="highlight-box">
            <p>"Coyote &amp; Quill is not competing with McKinsey or Deloitte. The firm is competing with the absence of a credible, precision-oriented AI advisory option for organizations that cannot afford a Big Four retainer and cannot trust a generic boutique."</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card" style="margin-top: 24px;">
            <p class="label" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Proprietary Product</p>
            <h3>TraceWell</h3>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 16px;">Healthcare SaaS platform — the firm's flagship product and live demonstration of custom app development capability.</p>
            <span class="badge badge-active"><span class="badge-dot"></span>Active Development</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="text-align: center;">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="label" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">Work With Us</p>
      <h2 style="max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto 24px;">Ready to observe, assess, and move?</h2>
      <p style="max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto 40px;">We work with a small number of clients at a time. If you're navigating AI adoption, want your team building with AI, or need something built — let's talk.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Start a Conversation</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* Each card leads with the leader's question (the hook), then names the offering (the answer). */
  .card-question {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--ice-blue);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
</style>
